{"id":"e91afa7b7e5241b9","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-skolem-hull.md","title":"Skolem Hull","display":"df-skolem-hull — Skolem Hull","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-skolem-hull","aliases":["57-df-skolem-hull"],"display":"df-skolem-hull — Skolem Hull","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-skolem-function]]","[[57-df-closure-operator]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-skolem-hull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-skolem-hull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolem-hull — Skolem Hull"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4284b81e17c97cd2\" href=\"?note=4284b81e17c97cd2\" title=\"57-df-skolem-function\">57-df-skolem-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8de756444081284\" href=\"?note=e8de756444081284\" title=\"57-df-closure-operator\">57-df-closure-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq A\">\\(X\\subseteq A\\)</span>。自由变量和变量的固定枚举见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cl}\">\\(\\mathrm{cl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e8de756444081284\" href=\"?note=e8de756444081284\" title=\"57-df-closure-operator\">57-df-closure-operator</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\{\\langle x,\\varphi\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}\">\\(J=\\{\\langle x,\\varphi\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=\\langle x,\\varphi\\rangle\">\\(j=\\langle x,\\varphi\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y_j\">\\(\\vec y_j\\)</span> 是按固定枚举递增排列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_j=|\\vec y_j|\">\\(n_j=|\\vec y_j|\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f_j)_{j\\in J}\">\\((f_j)_{j\\in J}\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_j:A^{n_j}\\to A\">\\(f_j:A^{n_j}\\to A\\)</span> 在环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A,x,\\vec y_j)\">\\((\\mathfrak A,x,\\vec y_j)\\)</span> 中满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4284b81e17c97cd2\" href=\"?note=4284b81e17c97cd2\" title=\"57-df-skolem-function\">57-df-skolem-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_j,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_j,\\varphi)\\)</span>。固定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不交的单射新符号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F_j)_{j\\in J}\">\\((F_j)_{j\\in J}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_j=0\">\\(n_j=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_j\">\\(F_j\\)</span> 为常量，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_j\">\\(n_j\\)</span> 元函数符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)\\)</span> 保留二元接口，省略的是本段已固定的函数选择与符号族，不把未解释的新符号直接放进原结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sk}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sk}\\)</span> 是扩张签名、解释及结构的上标标记；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{\\mathrm{Sk}},I^{\\mathrm{Sk}},\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\">\\(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}},I^{\\mathrm{Sk}},\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\)</span> 由下式根据已固定的新符号族和函数族定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq S\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\land n_j=0\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\land n_j=k\\}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nI^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq I\\cup\n\\{\\langle F_j,f_j(\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle:j\\in J\\land n_j=0\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle F_j,f_j\\rangle:j\\in J\\land n_j\\ge1\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,I^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{cl}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^{\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}(X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq S\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\land n_j=0\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\land n_j=k\\}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nI^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq I\\cup\n\\{\\langle F_j,f_j(\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle:j\\in J\\land n_j=0\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle F_j,f_j\\rangle:j\\in J\\land n_j\\ge1\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,I^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{cl}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^{\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}(X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_0(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Func}_0(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\quad(k\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Func}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\quad(k\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭包确实在扩张结构中取。包含零元见证函数，因此空生成集也能得到非空的 Skolem 闭包。原 Hull 调用的值仍是论域子集，不改为结构对象；对应子结构由限制原结构取得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-skolem-function","status":"resolved","id":"4284b81e17c97cd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-skolem-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e8de756444081284","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-closure-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$X\\subseteq A$。自由变量和变量的固定枚举见 [[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{cl}$ 见 [[57-df-closure-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$X\\subseteq A$。自由变量和变量的固定枚举见 [[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{cl}$ 见 [[57-df-closure-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e8de756444081284","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$X\\subseteq A$。自由变量和变量的固定枚举见 [[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{cl}$ 见 [[57-df-closure-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-skolem-function","status":"resolved","id":"4284b81e17c97cd2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定函数族 $(f_j)_{j\\in J}$，每个 $f_j:A^{n_j}\\to A$ 在环境 $(\\mathfrak A,x,\\vec y_j)$ 中满足 [[57-df-skolem-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_j,\\varphi)$。固定与 $S$ 不交的单射新符号族 $(F_j)_{j\\in J}$；$n_j=0$ 时 $F_j$ 为常量，否则为 $n_j$ 元函数符号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cl}","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\{\\langle x,\\varphi\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"j=\\langle x,\\varphi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n_j=|\\vec y_j|","display":false},{"tex":"(f_j)_{j\\in J}","display":false},{"tex":"f_j:A^{n_j}\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A,x,\\vec y_j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFn}(f_j,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"(F_j)_{j\\in J}","display":false},{"tex":"n_j=0","display":false},{"tex":"F_j","display":false},{"tex":"n_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sk}","display":false},{"tex":"S^{\\mathrm{Sk}},I^{\\mathrm{Sk}},\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nS^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&\\coloneqq S\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\land n_j=0\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S)\\cup\\{F_j:j\\in J\\land n_j=k\\}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S)\\quad(k\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\nI^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&\\coloneqq I\\cup\n\\{\\langle F_j,f_j(\\langle\\rangle)\\rangle:j\\in J\\land n_j=0\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle F_j,f_j\\rangle:j\\in J\\land n_j\\ge1\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}&\\coloneqq\\langle A,I^{\\mathrm{Sk}}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{cl}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^{\\mathfrak A^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}(X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_0(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\ge1}\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_{S^{\\mathrm{Sk}}}^k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_k(S^{\\mathrm{Sk}})\\quad(k\\ge1).","display":true}],"bytes":2845,"backlinks":[{"id":"731def36513a770d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[57-df-skolem-hull]] 的结构 $\\mathfrak A$、集合 $X\\subseteq A$ 和覆盖全部公式及其参数列的见证函数族，$H=\\mathrm{Hull}(\\mathfrak A,X)$。$\\mathcal I_H$ 按下式限制原 $S$-符号解释；$\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright H$ 是该限制结构，不是把整个有序对结构当作函数作限制。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-skolem-hull]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-a